  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Note: "Manages incoming eyetracking data, conversion and forwarding to dataclients.\nAlso
    checks valid eye gaze package against the `GazeCollision` layer for raycast hits.\n\n>
    EyeDataClients need to reference this EyeDataHandller on their inspector settings.\n>
    EyeDataClients need to implement the EyeDataClient interface. \n> Tick \"Process
    on Start\" on the EyeDataHandler if you want to push data to the clients right
    from the start. Otherwise you need to call the according method from code to
    start pushing. \n\n"
